{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029040303171-1029_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261028182432\"/><p>用家可通過滑鼠上的觸控屏切換控制面板。</p><p>美國一間初創公司推出的新型有線多功能滑鼠，在手掌下方內置約7.9厘米方型觸控屏，通過和軟件聯動，以大幅提升辦公與工作效率。</p><p>觸控屏支持5種顯示模式，包括快捷方式、觸控板、鍵盤、滑塊和日歷，可根據當前使用軟件自動切換控制面板。屏幕上方保留左右按鍵、滾輪等，並支持體感控制，可以通過移動滑鼠控制幻燈片翻頁。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T20:20:32.503019+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T20:03:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.598621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T20:18:29.959782+00:00","content_hash":"286d6a422d9fe9fae20909cc608bac10373da2794a985243e40cde51c20ef36a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T20:20:32.503019+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}